MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Pages take the names they have in the sidebar and lists (Login Items,
  Passwords, Language & Region…) instead of KDE's.
- Widget pages' forms: labels at the left, and a rounded panel behind
  forms not already in a group box or framed tab. QML forms built after
  the page opens are decorated too.
- Wi‑Fi's Details… opens a macOS-style sheet with the network's details
  (Plasma's network module), Forget This Network… and Advanced….
- MAC_TEST_TOUR=<dir> (and MAC_TEST_TOUR_ONLY) saves a picture of every
  page, for checking the app's look.

